<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116334" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡρῐκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in one's prime,
			blooming,</i> of the young people, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				272
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				235
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡ. νέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					14.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.8
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνυ γάρ ἐστιν ὡρικώτατα τὰ τιτθί᾽,
					ὥσπερ μῆλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crates Com.
					40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, πυνθάνει</span> you ask <i>so
				maidenly, so prettily,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				963
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span> (c) <i><span class="en">
				B.
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
